      "title": "Order detail lookup ignores the owner",
      "description": "The order_detail view fetches the order by primary key alone. It never checks that request.user owns the order. Any logged-in user can read the total and discount code of every order by changing the id in the URL. Add owner=request.user to the get_object_or_404 lookup, as the redeem view already does.",
      "suggested_change": "    order = get_object_or_404(Order, pk=order_id, owner=request.user)",
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "The order_detail view fetches the order by primary key alone. It never checks that request.user owns the order.",
      "consequence": "Any logged-in user can read the total and discount code of every order by changing the id in the URL.",
      "fix": "Add owner=request.user to the get_object_or_404 lookup, as the redeem view already does."
    },
