      "line_number": 20,
      "line_end": 20,
      "title": "Decimal total multiplied by a float",
      "description": "The apply_discount method multiplies a Decimal total by the float 0.9. Python raises TypeError when it mixes Decimal and float in multiplication. Every redeem request with the WELCOME10 code returns a server error. No user can ever apply the discount. Multiply by Decimal(\"0.9\") and quantize the result to two decimal places.",
      "suggested_change": "        self.total = (self.total * Decimal(\"0.9\")).quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"))",
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
