      "title": "CSRF protection disabled on a state-changing view",
      "description": "The redeem view changes an order and authenticates by session cookie. The decorator turns off CSRF checks for it. Any third-party site can make a logged-in user's browser submit redeem requests against that user's orders. Remove the csrf_exempt decorator and send the CSRF token from the client.",
